                        <p> 30.1.1806 sup at Lamb's w. Fricker and miss Stodart: This was George
                            Fricker, younger brother of Sara (Mrs Coleridge) and Martha (Mrs
                            Southey) bapt 2.6.1784 St James, Bath of Stephen and Martha Fricker, bur
                            27.6.1813 Crosthwaite, Cumberland. He died while staying with the
                            Southeys. Coleridge wrote to him in London in1806 encouraging him to
                            visit the Lambs. </p>
